ting heat."], ["Evaporator","Trade term \u2014 Evaporator: The indoor coil absorbing heat."], ["TXV","Trade term \u2014 TXV: Thermostatic expansion valve metering refrigerant into the evaporator."], ["Heat pump","Trade term \u2014 Heat pump: A reversible AC that heats by moving heat indoors."], ["SEER","Trade term \u2014 SEER: Seasonal energy efficiency ratio for cooling."], ["AFUE","Trade term \u2014 AFUE: Annual fuel utilization efficiency for furnaces."], ["HSPF","Trade term \u2014 HSPF: Heating seasonal performance factor for heat pumps."], ["MERV","Trade term \u2014 MERV: Filter efficiency rating; higher traps smaller particles."], ["CFM","Trade term \u2014 CFM: Cubic feet per minute of airflow."], ["Static pressure","Trade term \u2014 Static pressure: Resistance to airflow in ducts."], ["Brazing","Trade term \u2014 Brazing: High-temperature copper joining with filler rod."], ["Nitrogen purge","Trade term \u2014 Nitrogen purge: Flowing nitrogen while brazing to prevent internal oxidation."], ["Recovery","Trade term \u2014 Recovery: Legally required capture of refrigerant before opening systems."], ["Combustion analysis","Trade term \u2014 Combustion analysis: Measuring furnace exhaust for safe, efficient burning."], ["Zoning","Trade term \u2014 Zoning: Dampers and controls for different areas."]];
